whole necks down and goes thru a slot that it maybe as wide as a boat.  We carried on the right, left looked better.  Watch out for the stinging nettles on the bank.  We lowered the boats down a 40 cliff using ropes and biners and such.","caption":"Mandatory Portage","poi_name":"Mandatory Portage","subject":"","author":"Brad Roberts","poi_id":"633","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/2629","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/2629"}},{"id":"2631","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"1385","description":"Shayne nails the line on this one.","caption":"Shayne cranking a big boof","poi_name":"Falls after the portage","subject":"Shayne Day","author":"Brad Roberts","poi_id":"630","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/2631","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/2631"}},{"id":"2626","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"1385","description":"","caption":"First Big Slide","poi_name":"","subject":"Shayne Day","author":"Brad Roberts","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/2626","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/2626"}},{"id":"2630","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"1385","description":"Will is about 10 feet to far to the right on this one.  His boat made some unpleasant noises on the landing.  The landing zone on this one was way shallow.","caption":"Falls after the portage","poi_name":"Falls after the portage","subject":"Will Reeves","author":"Brad Roberts","poi_id":"630","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/2630","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/2630"}},{"id":"2627","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"1385","description":"The landing on this one was kinda hard.  You glance off the rocks on the way down.","caption":"First Big Falls","